      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "honestly, big agree. I feel a little bit like this is crossing a line. \n\nThere's a bit in the movie 'Ready Player One' where IOI is heavily criticized for trying to 'sell the player's field of vision' and i feel like these forced HUD popups are going down that route.\n\nI get that you must have a viable business model to run something like VRchat but please consider placing this on the action menu instead of forced into our field of vision. Let us keep control of our field of view.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
